---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Learn about Rotaract KUL's mission, vision and its connection to the wider Rotaract and Rotary network."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">About us</p>
      <h1>Students first. Service always.</h1>
      <p>Rotaract KUL is a student-led association built around the Rotaract model: a community of young people organising service, professional development and social impact for and with each other. We are a student initiative — not a formal organ of KU Leuven — welcoming students from KU Leuven, Odisee and beyond who want to do more with their time at university.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--tint">
    <div class="wrap grid grid--2">
      <div>
        <h2>Our mission</h2>
        <p>To give students a structured, welcoming way to serve their community, build professional skills and form lasting international friendships — grounded in the values of Rotaract.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>Our vision</h2>
        <p>A generation of students who see service and leadership as part of student life, not an afterthought — carrying that habit with them long after graduation.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap grid grid--2">
      <div>
        <h2>What Rotaract is</h2>
        <p>Rotaract is a global network of service-based clubs for young people, sponsored by Rotary International. Clubs organise their own service projects and professional development activities while staying connected to a much larger community of Rotaractors and Rotarians worldwide.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>Our place in that network</h2>
        <p>Rotaract KUL is being relaunched as part of that global family. We're building local relationships with Rotary clubs and the broader Rotaract community as we grow, and we'll share confirmed sponsorship and affiliation details here as they're finalised.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .intro { max-width: 70ch; }
  .intro p { font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--stone); }
</style>
